%% Generated by render-integration.py; edit that script and run make diagrams.
sequenceDiagram
    box Analytics application
        participant PX as Application
        participant PDB as PostgreSQL
    end
    box Trade Maneuver
        participant MQ as RabbitMQ
        participant TM as TM application
        participant TDB as TM PostgreSQL
    end
    participant OP as Operator
    participant BR as Simulated broker
    Note over PX,BR: Planned integration. Proximtype is an example producer and is not integrated. The local flow will use a demo analytics application.<br/>Fictional broker: no real orders.<br/>RabbitMQ transport. At-least-once delivery. Deduplication by id.
    %% 01 / Producer publication
    PX->>PDB: Data + outbox (atomic)
    PX->>PX: Translate to the v1 contract
    PX->>MQ: publish tm.trade-signal.v1
    MQ-->>PX: publisher confirm → outbox: sent
    %% 02 / Signal intake
    MQ->>TM: Deliver signal
    alt not processable / no valid id, unknown source, missing or mismatched user_id, or id reused with other content
    TM->>TDB: Audit only, no signal outcome
    TM-->>MQ: reject without requeue → dead letter queue
    else duplicate with the same content
    TM->>TDB: Audit + stored outcome, if any, back into the outbox
    TM-->>MQ: ack after commit
    else contract violation / SignalRejected
    TM->>TDB: inbox + trade signal + audit + outbox, one commit
    TM-->>MQ: ack after commit
    else valid trade signal
    TM->>TDB: inbox + trade signal + audit, one commit
    TM-->>MQ: ack after commit
    end
    %% 03 / Signal evaluation and order creation
    Note over TM,OP: Orchestrator: each step commits in its own transaction
    TM->>TM: Signal validity, then direction
    opt signal validity ended, or short trade signal / evaluation ends
    TM->>TDB: SignalDeclined in outbox, no broker call
    end
    TM->>BR: Look up the instrument
    BR-->>TM: Availability and quote currency
    TM->>TM: Availability, reference price currency, quote currency
    opt a check fails / evaluation ends
    TM->>TDB: SignalDeclined or SignalRejected in outbox
    end
    TM->>TM: Limit price and quantity
    alt quantity is zero
    TM->>TDB: SignalDeclined in outbox, no order
    else at least one unit
    TM->>TDB: Order awaiting approval + settings snapshot
    end
    %% 04 / Operator approval / manual execution mode
    alt approve
    OP->>TM: Approve, optionally with a new limit price
    TM->>TDB: Order approved, quantity recalculated for a new limit price
    else refuse
    OP->>TM: Refuse, with an optional audit note
    TM->>TDB: Order refused
    end
    %% 05 / Submission and execution
    Note over TM,BR: Wait for a trading session on the listing exchange
    TM->>TDB: Order submitting, intent committed
    TM->>BR: Submit the limit order with clientOrderId
    Note over TM,BR: On timeout: query order status with the broker.<br/>Do not submit the order again.
    alt broker rejects
    BR-->>TM: Rejected
    TM->>TDB: Order rejected
    else broker accepts
    BR-->>TM: Accepted, then fills
    TM->>TDB: Order open + execution progress, filled when complete
    end
    %% 06 / End of signal validity / time event
    alt order awaiting approval or approved
    TM->>TDB: Order lapsed
    else order open
    TM->>TDB: Order cancelling, reason committed
    TM->>BR: Cancel the remainder
    BR-->>TM: Cancellation confirmed, final fills
    TM->>TDB: Order expired, or filled if completely filled
    else order submitting / broker does not know it
    TM->>BR: Query order status by clientOrderId
    BR-->>TM: Order unknown
    TM->>TDB: Order lapsed
    else order submitting / broker unreachable
    TM->>BR: Query order status by clientOrderId
    TM->>TDB: Order stays submitting, queries continue past signal validity
    end
    %% 07 / Order cancellation
    alt operator cancels an approved order
    OP->>TM: Cancel
    TM->>TDB: Order cancelled, no broker call
    else operator cancels an open order
    OP->>TM: Cancel
    TM->>TDB: Order cancelling, reason committed
    TM->>BR: Cancel the remainder
    BR-->>TM: Cancellation confirmed, final fills
    TM->>TDB: Order cancelled, or filled if completely filled
    else cancelled by the broker
    BR-->>TM: External cancellation of an open order
    TM->>TDB: Order cancelled
    end
    %% 08 / Signal outcome and its delivery
    Note over TM,BR: After a terminal order status, in a separate commit:<br/>refused or lapsed → SignalDeclined | rejected → OrderRejected<br/>filled → OrderFilled | expired → OrderExpired | cancelled → OrderCancelled
    TM->>TDB: Signal outcome into the outbox
    TDB-->>TM: Dispatcher reads committed outbox entries
    TM->>MQ: publish to tm.signal-outcomes
    MQ-->>TM: publisher confirm → outbox: sent
    MQ-->>PX: tm.signal-outcomes → producer queue
    Note over PX,BR: Intake is acknowledged at once. The outcome may follow hours or days later. Each processable message ends with exactly one signal outcome, correlated by id.
